{"review_id": "13032875149", "app_id": "6745508692", "app_name": "Habit Tracker: Simple&Powerful", "country": "gb", "country_name": "United Kingdom", "rating": 3, "title": "It’s alright", "body": "There’s a few glitches and the most annoying thing is when u have more then 10 habits and you have to scroll down and tik them (as the habits are too big on the screen and you can’t narrow the list or decrease text size) the screen then jumps back to the top so if you want to tick multiple habits off the list you have to keep scrolling back to the bottom from the top again to tick them off. Would be amazing to get this adjusted. There is also very little functionality, it’s literally just a list of daily habits you can tick off. There isn’t any option for weekly habits or monthly habits which is a real shame. I would say not really worth the money but it is a great idea if some more time was put into sorting the glitches and adding a few more features would be 5 stars from me", "author": "Hxjdn", "date": "2025-08-18T21:41:29Z", "vote_count": 1, "vote_sum": 0, "is_edited": false}
